.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt DEQP-VK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm deqp-vk ,
.Nm glcts
.Nd run cases of the Khronos Vulkan and OpenGL conformance tests
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm /opt/vk-gl-cts- Ns Ar version Ns Pa /vulkan/deqp-vk
.Op Ar option ...
.Nm /opt/vk-gl-cts- Ns Ar version Ns Pa /gl/glcts
.Op Ar option ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The x86-64 GNU root installs two releases of VK-GL-CTS, 1.4.1.1 and 1.4.7.1, each under
.Pa /opt/vk-gl-cts- Ns Ar version ,
built for the surfaceless EGL platform.
.Nm
runs the dEQP-VK cases on the Vulkan drivers the loader finds, and
.Nm glcts
runs the dEQP-GLES2, dEQP-GLES3 and dEQP-GLES31 cases, among the others it has, on EGL and OpenGL ES.
Each reads its data from the directory it is started in, so it is started from its own directory.
.Pp
The common options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl n Ar case
Run the cases whose names match
.Ar case ,
in which
.Ql *
matches any part of a name.
.It Fl -deqp-caselist-file= Ns Ar file
Run the cases listed in
.Ar file ,
one a line.
.It Fl -deqp-log-filename= Ns Ar file
Write the test log to
.Ar file ,
TestResults.qpa by default.
.It Fl -deqp-surface-type= Ns Ar type
Draw to a
.Cm pbuffer
or another surface type the platform has; the GLES cases on the surfaceless platform use
.Cm pbuffer .
.It Fl -deqp-gl-config-name= Ns Ar name
Use the EGL configuration
.Ar name ,
such as
.Cm rgba8888d24s8ms0 .
.It Fl -deqp-watchdog=enable
End a case that runs longer than the watchdog's limits, as Timeout.
.El
.Pp
Each case prints its name and then its status: Pass, Fail, NotSupported, QualityWarning, CompatibilityWarning, ResourceError, InternalError, Crash or Timeout.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width EGL_PLATFORM
.It Ev EGL_PLATFORM
Set to
.Cm surfaceless
for
.Nm glcts ;
without it Mesa's EGL takes another platform and finds no display.
.It Ev VK_DRIVER_FILES
The Vulkan drivers' manifests the loader reads, to choose one driver.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /opt/vk-gl-cts- Ns Ar version Ns Pa /mustpass
The case lists, compressed: vk-default.txt.gz, the Vulkan list, and gles2-main.txt.gz, gles3-main.txt.gz and gles31-main.txt.gz, the AOSP GLES lists.
.It Pa /opt/vk-gl-cts- Ns Ar version Ns Pa /build-info
The release, its pinned sources, the build's options and compiler, and the length of each list.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Run the GLES 2 information cases on llvmpipe:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
cd /opt/vk-gl-cts-1.4.7.1/gl
EGL_PLATFORM=surfaceless ./glcts -n 'dEQP-GLES2.info.*' \e
    --deqp-surface-type=pbuffer --deqp-gl-config-name=rgba8888d24s8ms0
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vulkaninfo 1
